./docs/plans/2026-04-21-sso-user-identity-linkage/design.md:173:That distinction matters because the design choice is not "copy GitLab exactly"; it is "use the multi-provider separate-identity family, keep memos-compatible table naming, and adopt upstream-aligned linkage fields where they improve recognizability" (G4).
